  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/docs2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: websocket.py:303 DJANGO_ASYNC_SEND is still async_to_sync\\s*\\(\\s*channel_layer..., applied at :614 with DJANGO_CHANNEL_SEND. Tested the compiled patterns: 'async_to_sync(self.channel_layer.send)(\"chat\",...)' and the group_send form match neither (False/False). The bare 'async_to_sync(channel_layer.send)' matches. DJANGO_CONSUMER_SEND/DJANGO_CHANNELS_ROUTE are still compiled but never applied, as the docstring says. MECHANISM: send regex anchors on bare channel_layer, so self.channel_layer inside async_to_sync never matches."  # 98fe
